WEBVTT

00:15:28.875 --> 00:15:32.101
The fungi just happens to be
a living machine.

00:15:32.125 --> 00:15:35.434
What would happen
if we compare and compete

00:15:35.458 --> 00:15:38.601
the trading strategies of these two?

00:15:38.625 --> 00:15:39.976
Who would win?

00:15:40.000 --> 00:15:43.476
The tiny capitalist that's been around

00:15:43.500 --> 00:15:48.851
since before and
the fall of the dinosaurs?

00:15:48.875 --> 00:15:50.708
My money is on the fungus.

00:15:51.417 --> 00:15:52.684
Thank you.

00:15:52.708 --> 00:15:56.000
(Applause)